title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf field
catalog: CLI command
target: mf field
summary: Field operations: list the repo's field names, or access a row by id

!! Reference

```
Field operations: list the repo's field names, or access a row by id

Usage: mf field [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list    List the distinct field names of the repository (with their value type)
  get     Print a field row by its id
  set     Change a row's name and/or value in place, keeping its id
  delete  Delete a field row by its id
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
```
